Vince was just a voodoo doll in a French Quarter shop, but when his maker was kidnapped, he became a vengeful doll on a mission! Using voodoo powers, Vince must kick his own butt to beat his enemies! If he stand under a falling safe, bad guys get flattened! Stick a pitch fork in him, and his enemies are done!', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/voodoo-vince', '["Xbox"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 8.01, '2026-08-22 01:37:44', '2026-08-22 01:37:44');
